=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guild has entrusted you with a wand capable of unleashing powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now ready to take on quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive—if you fall, you’ll never unleash your full power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun chaos destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 elements to combine unlocking different way to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic and immersive combat. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embrace the journey of <strong>The Novice</strong>? <strong>Find the source of the madness now!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Survive relentless waves of burning beasts. Collect gems and complete quests to buy powerful upgrades. Rise through the ranks of the adventurer’s guild to unlock new map and quests. Your goal: find the cause of the chaos!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551350/d7b98a24ee0f4c93935299631213f603b3e4e8a9/header.jpg?t=1754355735", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551350/32c0da7ec4d5b7695265e06b68dbb87da49f0779/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754355735", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551350/32c0da7ec4d5b7695265e06b68dbb87da49f0779/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754355735", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz or b